{"title":"Rimeworm Hatchling","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 60 Rimeworm that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rimeworm-hatchling\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rimeworm-hatchling?lv=60\">Lv 60 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/rimeworm-hatchling?lv=61\">Lv 61 <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rimeworm-hatchling?lv=60\" title=\"Pick level 60\"><td><b>60</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>455</td><td>37.5</td><td>3,000</td><td class=\"muted\">1,365 · 52.5 · 9,000</td><td>1</td><td>in the wilds around 86, -1225</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/rimeworm-hatchling\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>61</b></td><td>462</td><td>38.1</td><td>3,050</td><td class=\"muted\">1,386 · 53.3 · 9,150</td><td>2</td><td>in the wilds around 87, -1225</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"rimeworm-hatchling\" data-map-level=\"61\">Show level 61 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-2675.8px,1746.3px)\"><i style=\"left:2675.8px;top:-1746.3px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around -149, -1122 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>in the wilds around 87, -1225 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"rimeworm-hatchling\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Rimeworm: <a href=\"#/monster/rimeworm\">Rimeworm</a> <span class=\"muted\">(62)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rimeworm-elder\">Rimeworm Elder</a> <span class=\"muted\">(63)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rimeworm-queen\">Rimeworm Queen</a> <span class=\"muted\">(64)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/97d662180bb216adaaf8.svg\" alt=\"Rimeworm Hatchling\"></div><h3>Rimeworm Hatchling</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>61</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 60)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Rimeworm</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>462</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>38.1</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3,050</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.4 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.9</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>3 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}